# Watched by uptime-alert.timer every minute. One per line: URL, then a name.
# Installed to /etc/uptime-alert.list by pve-deploy.
#
# Only the home box for now. This box's own services include a printer and a
# hazer that are switched off as a matter of routine - alerting on those would
# be noise. The home box's peer-sync refreshes this file every 5 minutes.
file:/var/log/peer/promox/status.json      home box check-in (promox)
https://home.anthonychiappone.com          home dashboard (home.anthonychiappone.com)
